{"id":"n61058-1-10","stage":2,"title":"비결 · 秘诀","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61058-1-10-1","ko":"아름다워진 비결을 알려 주세요.","zh":"请告诉我您变美的秘诀吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아름다워진","meaning":"变漂亮的、变美的","explanation":"아름답다：美丽、漂亮；-아/어지다：变得。아름다워진 비결 指变漂亮的秘诀，不是品德或心地美好。","readings":[{"term":"아름답다","audio":"/audio/b39be518859c28e09afb.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71290","senseId":"1","lemma":"아름답다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아름다워진","audio":"/audio/426db3ab6a8180bfb905.mp3"}},{"text":"비결을","meaning":"秘诀，诀窍","explanation":"비결：秘诀，诀窍；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"비결","audio":"/audio/e80595c627558639e95b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61058","senseId":"1","lemma":"비결","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비결을","audio":"/audio/8546ad4cf71ae4cbfe54.mp3"}},{"text":"알려","meaning":"告知","explanation":"알리다：告知；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"알리다","audio":"/audio/c8eae4fd8a7a21d57d22.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29770","senseId":"1","lemma":"알리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알려","audio":"/audio/1418ba446b159cc48aac.mp3"}},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주세요","audio":"/audio/97f2a1d4f468faba426d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b39be518859c28e0","term":"아름답다","zh":"美丽、漂亮","audio":"/audio/b39be518859c28e09afb.mp3","entryId":"71290","definition":"美丽、漂亮","pronunciation":["아름답따"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]},{"id":"e80595c627558639","term":"비결","zh":"秘诀，诀窍","audio":"/audio/e80595c627558639e95b.mp3","entryId":"61058","definition":"没有公之于众的自己独有的卓越方法。","pronunciation":["비ː결"]},{"id":"c8eae4fd8a7a21d5","term":"알리다","zh":"告知","audio":"/audio/c8eae4fd8a7a21d57d22.mp3","entryId":"29770","definition":"使醒悟或得知原本不知道或忘记的事情。","pronunciation":["알리다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d993681041e42f6c820c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61058-1-10-2","ko":"별것 없어요. 긍정적으로 살면 돼요.","zh":"没什么特别的，只要积极生活就好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"별것","meaning":"特别的东西、特别的事情","explanation":"별것 是名词，表示不同寻常的事情或东西；별것 없어요 表示没什么特别的。","readings":[{"term":"별것","audio":"/audio/dfd648f1400ea4cf6528.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58420","senseId":"1","lemma":"별것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"별것","audio":"/audio/dfd648f1400ea4cf6528.mp3"}},{"text":"없어요.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없어요","audio":"/audio/a3a387384b956d187d4f.mp3"}},{"text":"긍정적으로","meaning":"正面的，积极的","explanation":"긍정적：正面的，积极的；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"긍정적","audio":"/audio/2a3aa050974245f69f74.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40132","senseId":"2","lemma":"긍정적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"긍정적으로","audio":"/audio/95028101b9705ba1ed0c.mp3"}},{"text":"살면","meaning":"生活，过活，过日子","explanation":"살다：生活，过活，过日子；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"2","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"살면","audio":"/audio/fbe06d0e2b69144b53c9.mp3"}},{"text":"돼요.","meaning":"能，行","explanation":"되다：能，行；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돼요","audio":"/audio/9f1cdf460348e44aca12.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"dfd648f1400ea4cf","term":"별것","zh":"特别的东西、特别的事情","audio":"/audio/dfd648f1400ea4cf6528.mp3","entryId":"58420","definition":"特别的东西、特别的事情","pronunciation":["별걷"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人或事物等实际上不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"2a3aa050974245f6","term":"긍정적","zh":"正面的，积极的","audio":"/audio/2a3aa050974245f69f74.mp3","entryId":"40132","definition":"可取或值得看好。","pronunciation":["긍ː정적"]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"生活，过活，过日子","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3","entryId":"69579","definition":"人过生活。","pronunciation":["살ː다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"能，行","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情可行或被允许。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9bebd261352752e45a51.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.662,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=61058","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":87,"sequenceScore":2.3873,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["没什么特别的，只要积极生活就好。","请告诉我您变美的秘诀吧。","智秀穿的衣服真漂亮。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["请告诉我您变美的秘诀吧。","智秀穿的衣服真漂亮。","没什么特别的，只要积极生活就好。"],"answer":2}]}
